<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ to TEPCO straight bonds.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ to TEPCO straight bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poors Corp said on Friday that it had assigned its AA+ rating to Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc's (TEPCO) $500 million worth of 7.125 percent straight bonds due June 13, 2007.</p>
<p>The rating outlook is stable, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
